{"page":334,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:16","surah":22,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ ءَايَـٰتٍۭ بَيِّنَـٰتٍ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَهْدِى مَن يُرِيدُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this way, We send the Quran down as clear messages, and God guides whoever He will.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We sent it down","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","en_gloss":"(as) clear Verses","transliteration":"āyātin","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(as) clear Verses","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"He intends","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"22:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:16"}]},{"verse_key":"22:17","surah":22,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوا۟ وَٱلصَّـٰبِـِٔينَ وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ وَٱلْمَجُوسَ وَٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَفْصِلُ بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for the believers, those who follow the Jewish faith, the Sabians, the Christians, the Magians, and the idolaters, God will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection; God witnesses all things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"22:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"22:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":