,"en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:17"}]},{"verse_key":"22:18","surah":22,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَسْجُدُ لَهُۥ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱلشَّمْسُ وَٱلْقَمَرُ وَٱلنُّجُومُ وَٱلْجِبَالُ وَٱلشَّجَرُ وَٱلدَّوَآبُّ وَكَثِيرٌ مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ وَكَثِيرٌ حَقَّ عَلَيْهِ ٱلْعَذَابُ ۗ وَمَن يُهِنِ ٱللَّهُ فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن مُّكْرِمٍ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَآءُ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you not realize [Prophet] that everything in the heavens and earth submits to God: the sun, the moon, the stars, the mountains, the trees, and the animals? So do many human beings, though for many others punishment is well deserved. Anyone disgraced by God will have no one to honour him: God does whatever He will.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(to) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَسْجُدُ","en_gloss":"prostrates","transliteration":"yasjudu","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"22:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱلشَّمْسُ","en_gloss":"and the sun","transliteration":"wal-shamsu","verse_key":"22:18"},